<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">OnFly: Onboard Zero-Shot Aerial Vision-Language Navigation 
<br class="ltx_break">toward Safety and Efficiency
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Guiyong Zheng
